__pycache__/
*.bak
*.pyc
pixelharness_debug.log

# Vendored sketchKeras.
#
# model.pth IS tracked. The node cannot run without it, and upstream's answer -- "download it from this Google
# Drive link" -- makes a shipped workflow that throws FileNotFoundError until somebody reads a README. 71 MB is
# a fair price for line-thicken-sketchkeras working out of the box.
#
# mod.h5 is NOT. It is the original Keras file that src/fromkeras.py converts INTO model.pth; nothing loads it
# at runtime, and at 214 MB it exceeds what GitHub accepts anyway.
vendor/sketchKeras-pytorch/weights/*
!vendor/sketchKeras-pytorch/weights/.gitkeep
!vendor/sketchKeras-pytorch/weights/model.pth
vendor/sketchKeras-pytorch/outputs/
